OL,3,GNEWSANew push to turn island into
OL,4,Ascreen destination
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe film industry is calling for the
OL,7,Fcreation of a new commission to make it
OL,8,Feasier for productions to shoot in
OL,9,FJersey.
OL,11,FFilmmakers, politicians and investors
OL,12,Fmet at the Jersey Screen Summit on
OL,13,FMonday to discuss developing a
OL,14,Fsustainable film and television
OL,15,Findustry.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
