OL,3,GNEWSANew push to turn island into
OL,4,Ascreen destination
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was organised by director Rebecca
OL,7,FColey as a way to get government and
OL,8,Ffilm sector representatives "on the
OL,9,Fsame page" and she said the creation of
OL,10,Fa commission would "be a one port of
OL,11,Fcall for all productions happening
OL,12,Fhere".
OL,14,FAssistant Economic Development Minister
OL,15,FSenator Serena Kirsten said the
OL,16,Fgovernment was looking at options to
OL,17,Fsupport the industry but added further
OL,18,Ftalks were needed to get it "right".
